{"metadata":{"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"Artin–Schreier理论"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"Artin–Schreier 理论"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>设 $X$ 为 $\\mathbb F_p$-"},{"Local":{"url":"概形","text":"概形"}},{"Plain":", 则有 $X$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"平展意象","text":"平展意象"}},{"Plain":"中的 Abel 群的正合列\n$$\r\n0\\to \\mathbb{Z}/p\\to \\mathbb A^1 \\overset{\\mathrm{Frob}-1}{\\to} \\mathbb A^1\\to 0,\r\n$$\n其中 $\\mathrm{Frob}$ 为 "},{"Local":{"url":"Frobenius态射","text":"Frobenius 态射"}},{"Plain":".\n它给出 ("},{"Local":{"url":"平展上同调","text":"平展"}},{"Plain":") "},{"Local":{"url":"上同调","text":"上同调"}},{"Plain":"的长正合列\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n    0 &amp;\\to \\mathbb{Z}/p\\to \\mathcal O(X) \\overset{\\mathrm{Frob}-1}{\\to} \\mathcal O(X) \\\\\r\n    &amp;\\to H^1(X,\\mathbb{Z}/p) \\to H^1(X,\\mathbb A^1) \\overset{\\mathrm{Frob}-1}{\\to} H^1(X,\\mathbb A^1)\\\\\r\n    &amp;\\to\\cdots.\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$</p>\n<p>对应于 $a\\in\\mathcal O(X)$ 的 $\\mathbb{Z}/p$-"},{"Local":{"url":"主丛","text":"主丛"}},{"Plain":"为拉回\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}\r\n    {ccc}\r\n    ? &amp; \\to &amp; \\mathbb A^1\\\\\r\n    \\downarrow &amp; &amp; \\downarrow \\mathclap{\\hspace{2.5em}\\scriptsize \\operatorname{Frob} - 1}\\\\\r\n    X &amp; \\underset{a}{\\to} &amp; \\mathbb A^1,\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$\n即\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n    X' &amp;= \\{(x,t)\\in X\\times\\mathbb A^1\\mid t^p-t= a(x)\\}\r\n    \\\\&amp;=\\underline{\\operatorname{Spec}}_X (\\mathcal O_X [t]/(t^p-t-a)).\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p>设 $X=\\operatorname{Spec} A$, $A$ 为 $\\mathbb F_p$-代数. 此时 $H^1(X,\\mathbb A^1)=0$, 故 $X$ 上的所有 $\\mathbb{Z}/p$-"},{"Local":{"url":"主丛","text":"主丛"}},{"Plain":"均形如 $\\operatorname{Spec} A[t]/(t^p-t-a)$, 而这个主丛平凡当且仅当 $a$ 形如 $b^p-b\\,(b\\in A)$.</p>\n"}]}}